msgid "⟪k:0⟫Holding my breath, I took a few moments to ponder."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Затаив дыхание, я некоторое время пребывала в размышлениях."

#: scenario2:scenario2_83074F67_A2B5_4144_B7B8_320B30871810
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 828e6468d2b824d53838f82169856f83b315ba78dd42ae528f9a34c56552c543
